,"分享停車相關資訊",null,null,"請提供停車場地點和停車位數量等資訊","停車場",null,"0ahUKEwjFj9Xqu9KWAxXzia8BHUCdO5IQ3IcHCPoBKBI",null,null,["no"],null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_KID_FRIENDLINESS_TIPS"],"親子友善程度",null,null,"分享親子友善程度相關資訊","親子友善程度",null,"0ahUKEwjFj9Xqu9KWAxXzia8BHUCdO5IQ3IcHCPsBKBM",null,null,["no"],null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_ACCESSIBILITY_TIPS"],"無障礙設施",null,null,"分享無障礙空間相關資訊","無障礙設施",null,"0ahUKEwjFj9Xqu9KWAxXzia8BHUCdO5IQ3IcHCPwBKBQ",null,null,["no"],null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:VEGETARIAN_OPTIONS"],"素食餐點",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjFj9Xqu9KWAxXzia8BHUCdO5IQ3YcHCP4BKAA"],[["E:OTHER_DIETARY_RESTRICTIONS"],"特殊餐點",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjFj9Xqu9KWAxXzia8BHUCdO5IQ3YcHCP8BKAE"],[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjFj9Xqu9KWAxXzia8BHUCdO5IQ3YcHCIACKAI"],[["E:KID_FRIENDLINESS"],"親子友善程度",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjFj9Xqu9KWAxXzia8BHUCdO5IQ3YcHCIECKAM"],[["E:ACCESSIBILITY"],"無障礙設施",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjFj9Xqu9KWAxXzia8BHUCdO5IQ3YcHCIICKAQ"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjFj9Xqu9KWAxXzia8BHUCdO5IQ3IcHCP0BKBU",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["店內悶熱與海鮮腥味： 一進店裡就能感受到整間店充滿了一股非常悶的海鮮味，加上室內空氣很不流通，濃烈的蝦蟹海鮮氣味悶在密閉空間裡，聞久了其實有些不太舒服，整體的用餐環境體感顯得有些沉悶與壓迫。\n\n餐點普通缺乏記憶點： 備受期待的招牌拉麵餐點，整體表現吃起來卻是普普通通。雖然主打濃郁蝦湯風味，但口味上中規中矩、沒有太大的驚艷感，吃到後面反而容易覺得膩口，在強敵環伺的拉麵市場中，美味度缺少了一點靈魂。\n\n價位偏高不符期待： 結合了中規中矩的餐點表現，以及需要大幅改善的通風環境，整體的販售價位顯得偏高了一些。以這樣的消費金額來說，表現應該要更精緻，整體的用餐體驗讓 CP 值顯得有些不上不下。",null,[0,95]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/12138693963750328653/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFHVTAweVVUUmtXSEJRWVRCT1UyVkVSbmhXYTJSdlZFUkdTbG93UlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/12138693963750328653/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMjFHVTAweVVUUmtXSEJRWVRCT1UyVkVSbmhXYTJSdlZFUkdTbG93UlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/12138693963750328653/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZU